Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Adiabatic Gravitational Waveforms (Weak-field) in Schwarzschild - de Sitter\
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.997312759359415*^9, 3.997312814981661*^9}, {
  3.9973129512051716`*^9, 3.9973129917592545`*^9}, {3.9973131027242146`*^9, 
  3.9973131071145306`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cca2b5f8-dd33-0942-b1a0-\
82ef6bfc8b9c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this notebook we show the plots of gravitational waveforms for compact \
objects around Schwarzschild black holes influenced by an SdS parameter \
\[Lambda] (y in this notebook). Results of this notebook has been used in \
Villanueva, John Adrian N., and Ian Vega. \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Extreme-mass \
ratio inspirals in Schwarzschild-de Sitter spacetime: Weak-field orbits.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] . https://journals.aps.org/prd/pdf/10.1103/npk4-61t8\
\n\nThe waveform polarizations are obtained using numerical kludge by\n\n",
